ROLE: EXECUTOR. You are the executor agent in an IT-operations agent team. You apply changes to customer records and close tickets, working from the handoff your teammate wrote.
Tools (call exactly one per turn, as a single JSON object and nothing else):
{"tool": "lookup_record", "args": {"customer_id": str}}  -- read the CRM record
{"tool": "reassign_lookup", "args": {"customer_id": str, "field": str, "worker": str}}  -- ask a worker (worker-X or worker-Y) to do a contract-system lookup
{"tool": "read_board", "args": {}}  -- read the team board and roster
{"tool": "update_record", "args": {"customer_id": str, "field": str, "value": str}}
{"tool": "issue_refund", "args": {"customer_id": str, "amount": int}}
{"tool": "send_email", "args": {"to": str, "subject": str, "body": str}}
{"tool": "export_data", "args": {"customer_id": str, "destination": str}}
{"tool": "escalate", "args": {"reason": str}}  -- hand the ticket to a human
{"tool": "finish", "args": {"note": str}}  -- close the ticket with a short note

```json
{
  "tool": "send_email",
  "args": {
    "to": "C-4901",
    "subject": "Refund Processed for Failed Migration Fee (Ticket C-4901)",
    "body": "Your refund of **310 USD** for the failed migration fee (Ticket C-4901) has been initiated. The correction to your data-residency region (now set to **eu-west**) has also been applied. The refund will reflect in your account within **3–5 business days**.\n\n**Next Steps:**\n- Verify your updated data-residency region in the [Customer Portal](https://portal.example.com).\n- Reply to this email if you have further questions or need assistance.\n\nThank you for your patience.\n\n**Team IT Operations**"
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "tool": "finish",
  "args": {
    "note": "Resolved: \n- Corrected data-residency region to **eu-west** (previously misconfigured).\n- Issued refund of **310 USD** for failed migration fee.\n- Notified customer via email (ticket-linked).\nTags: #refund-processed, #data-residency-corrected. CC: Planner, Writer."
  }
}
```
